{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103674","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103674/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103674/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103674/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103674","id":2899308225,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc6sz-7B","number":103674,"title":"Loading a scene with ResourceLoader.LoadThreadedRequest and useSubThreads=true can cause a deadlock with C# scripts","user":{"login":"coolrox95","id":58208131,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU4MjA4MTMx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/58208131?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/coolrox95","html_url":"https://github.com/coolrox95","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coolrox95/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coolrox95/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coolrox95/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coolrox95/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coolrox95/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coolrox95/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coolrox95/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coolrox95/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coolrox95/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":709269775,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MDkyNjk3NzU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:dotnet","name":"topic:dotnet","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1332303119,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzMyMzAzMTE5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/regression","name":"regression","color":"ff63ac","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/22","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22/labels","id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","number":22,"title":"4.5","description":"","creator":{"login":"Sauermann","id":6299227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyOTkyMjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6299227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann","html_url":"https://github.com/Sauermann","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":3687,"state":"closed","created_at":"2024-12-19T08:51:28Z","updated_at":"2026-09-04T21:48:38Z","due_on":"2025-09-15T00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2025-09-18T17:13:14Z"},"comments":3,"created_at":"2025-03-06T04:34:51Z","updated_at":"2025-07-30T09:34:30Z","closed_at":"2025-07-29T21:54:33Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in v4.4.stable.mono, v4.4.dev7.mono, v4.4.dev4.mono, v4.3.dev3.mono, v4.3.dev2.mono\n- Not reproducible in v4.3.stable.mono, v4.4.dev1.mono, \n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.4.stable.mono - Windows 10 (build 19045) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - Vulkan (Mobile) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 2070 (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.6636) - Intel(R) Core(TM) i5-8600K CPU @ 3.60GHz (6 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nCalling `ResourceLoader.LoadThreadedRequest` with the `useSubThreads` option set to `true` can cause a deadlock after subsequently calling `ResourceLoader.LoadThreadedGet`. Example code from MRP:\n\n```cs\nResourceLoader.LoadThreadedRequest(\"res://scene_to_load.tscn\", nameof(PackedScene), true);\n// The engine will hang after this line, and become unresponsive\nPackedScene sceneA = (PackedScene)ResourceLoader.LoadThreadedGet(\"res://scene_to_load.tscn\");\n```\n\nNot all scenes seem to exhibit this behavior, and the specific layout of the nodes / class hierarchy appears to matter.\n\nPolling the load request with `ResourceLoader.LoadThreadedGetStatus` (instead of calling LoadThreadedGet), consistently returns `InProgress` with a progress value of `0.0`.\n\nDebugging the project in Visual Studio and breaking all after the project freezes, then viewing the threads in the `Parallel Stacks` window shows 2 threads that have called `ScriptManagerBridge.GetOrCreateScriptBridgeForPath` that never resolve.\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6f95cce9-3691-4674-afad-7eb86eb1dd2c)\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nOpen and run the MRP. Click the Load button, and the engine should deadlock and become unresponsive.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[deadlock-mrp.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/19101009/deadlock-mrp.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"coolrox95","id":58208131,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU4MjA4MTMx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/58208131?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/coolrox95","html_url":"https://github.com/coolrox95","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coolrox95/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coolrox95/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coolrox95/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coolrox95/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coolrox95/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coolrox95/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coolrox95/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coolrox95/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coolrox95/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103674/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103674/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}